   "source": [
    "# Rawaj Outreach & Follow-Up Agent\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is the interactive entrypoint for the team's Outreach & Follow-Up Agent. The actual stateful implementation lives in the adjacent Python files so it can join the shared team workflow without copying notebook cells into other agents.\n",
    "\n",
    "Scope: receive Research + Qualification results, generate a grounded outreach email, request Human Approval, submit only through a configured real email provider, process Interested / Not Interested responses, hand off an Interested prospect to the teammate-owned Strategy Agent, receive a Strategy output, and manage contextual follow-up safely. It does not generate a marketing strategy or process payments."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6582a078",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Workflow at a glance\n",
    "\n",
    "`Observe → load context/memory → decide → optional Calendar read → generate → validate/review → Human Approval interrupt → real provider execution → persist memory → next action`\n",
    "\n",
    "For an Interested response, the route is `verify button → record response → Strategy handoff → wait for Strategy output`. The Strategy Agent remains owned by its teammate."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "30f7734f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Project root: C:\\Users\\alamr\\Downloads\\Rawaj_Project_SDA-main\\Rawaj_Project_SDA-main\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
