    "## 9. Response buttons, Strategy handoff, and scheduled reassessment\n",
    "\n",
    "Run the FastAPI app to host signed email-button confirmation pages. A verified `Interested` response is persisted and placed in the narrow Strategy handoff outbox. When the teammate Strategy Agent returns a matching, client-notification-ready output, call `receive_strategy_agent_output(...)`; Outreach validates it, drafts the Free Trial notification, and pauses again for Human Approval.\n",
    "\n",
    "The scheduler invokes reassessment only for due records. It never approves, sends, or treats a timer as blind permission to email."
   ]
